<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila bipectinata Turing wavelength at 1.92 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each measurement method string names the equation or the segmentation rule it implements. The Lean theorems encode the integer diffusivity identities used by chronoseries(). The nonlinear wavelength is traced to the radial mode of the saturated field rather than hidden inside the linear solve." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila bipectinata Turing wavelength at 1.92 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The code implements Schnakenberg kinetics, the Turing wavenumber, and a discrete dispersion relation whose eigenmode growth correlates with the formula at r = 0.99478. gamma is derived so the continuous focal wavelength is 1.92 µm. Fidelity is not higher because that wavelength is the assigned rung rather than a constant published for this species." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila bipectinata Turing wavelength at 1.92 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Even-mode Pearson r = 0.99478 (reference 1.0). Held-out odd-mode RMSE = 0.01287 s^-1 (reference 0). KS distance = 0.125 (reference 0). Nonlinear wavelength 2.56 µm is not set equal to the linear 1.92 µm reference. Ablation amplification 0.0388 versus Turing amplification 89.6. Specimen foreground at the verifier threshold is 0.3233 versus the percentile-85 mask, and coherency is 0.755 versus an isotropic baseline of 0.5." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-du-sweep-wavelength-at-phi-2-25-versus-phi-0-49>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-ablation-amplification-of-activator-std>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-even-mode-dispersion-pearson-r-of-numerical-eigenmode-growth-vs-discrete-sigma-k>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-focal-linear-turing-wavelength-against-the-86-m-sibling-rung>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-held-out-odd-mode-dispersion-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-ks-distance-between-analytical-and-numerical-growth-rate-lists>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-nonlinear-selected-pigment-wavelength-on-the-15-36-m-patch>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-predecessor-drosophila-biarmipes-linear-wavelength-at-0-ma>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-foreground-fraction-at-contrast-percentile-45>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-structure-tensor-coherency>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-successor-drosophila-buzzatii-linear-wavelength-at-0-ma>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila bipectinata Turing wavelength at 1.92 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 85.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 closes the four Pass-1 remediations. The seven-point D_u sweep is monotonic (self-test). Equal diffusion with an 0.8% white-noise seed amplifies by 0.0388 while the Turing run amplifies by 89.6. Specimen foreground fraction is 0.3233 at the verifier threshold and differs from the percentile-85 mask. Even-mode Pearson r is 0.99478 against a reference of 1.0; odd-mode RMSE is 0.01287 against 0; KS is 0.125 against 0. The last GIF frame matches the pinned specimen at CV similarity 93.0. Weighted overall is 85.3. Overall 85.3/100 (faithfulness 84.9, reproducibility 86.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, matplotlib 3.11.2, Pillow 13.0.0, scipy 1.18.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 80, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_bipectinata_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/gif, 3266791 B, 640×480 px, 13 frames, artifact_sha256 1c0014b74396d41aea1c5fed8b925dfed4668c3d0198033eb7281e541fec2fdc (sha256 1c0014b74396d41aea1c5fed8b925dfed4668c3d0198033eb7281e541fec2fdc), spec_fingerprint d5f22a094ff81c9bfb8cec455feea78ef577fb724b6dfb1571cde0d7f6d97c6c. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d5f22a094ff81c9bfb8cec455feea78ef577fb724b6dfb1571cde0d7f6d97c6c; artifact_sha256: 1c0014b74396d41aea1c5fed8b925dfed4668c3d0198033eb7281e541fec2fdc. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952: a finite critical wavenumber can be selected by diffusion. | Schnakenberg 1979: kinetics a - u + u^2 v and b - u^2 v. | Kopp & True 2002, Mishra & Singh 2006, and Hurtado-Gonzales et al. 2014 describe D. bipectinata sex combs. None of them states a 1.92 µm wavenumber. | Gompel et al. 2005 is the predecessor citation for D. biarmipes wing pigment.; reconstructed_in_script: Focal linear wavelength 1.92 µm by solving gamma at D_u = 0.0504 µm^2/s and delta = 31.5. | At 0 Ma, D. biarmipes (D_u × 25/16) selects 2.40 µm and D. buzzatii (D_u × 16/25) selects 1.536 µm. | Saturated activator on the 64×64 grid selects 2.56 µm, which is reported rather than forced back to 1.92.; transfer_boundary: Melanin optical density on the gallery JPEG is a visualization of the activator, not a photograph of a 1.92 µm granule field.; does_not_claim: A wet-lab measurement of 1.92 µm in D. bipectinata. | Stratigraphic ancestry among D. biarmipes, D. bipectinata, and D. buzzatii. | That the catalog DOI 10.1111/j.1525-142X.2005.05044.x belongs to this morphology. It is a zebrafish myostatin paper.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.53e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila bipectinata Turing wavelength at 1.92 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Parameter expressivity: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "du_sweep samples seven diffusivities from phi 0.49 to 2.25. self_test asserts that lambda is strictly increasing. The chronoseries places biarmipes at 2.40 µm, the focal species at 1.92 µm, and buzzatii at 1.536 µm, which is the sqrt(D_u) control the law claims. The comparison figure states the sweep endpoints." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-bipectinata-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

